WEBVTT

00:00:00.584 --> 00:00:01.150
Hello!

00:00:01.220 --> 00:00:05.470
Every morning when you open VaraaAi, the Overview page tells you at once:

00:00:05.574 --> 00:00:09.870
how many customers you have today, how revenue is going, and what's waiting for you.

00:00:10.045 --> 00:00:10.830
Let's take a look.

00:00:11.496 --> 00:00:16.029
At the top is your greeting, today's number of appointments, the expected revenue,

00:00:15.979 --> 00:00:16.849
and who's next.

00:00:17.384 --> 00:00:21.524
The buttons below open your calendar, your messages, your salon's page,

00:00:21.474 --> 00:00:24.289
and copy your booking link to send to customers.

00:00:24.898 --> 00:00:26.708
Next are four numbers for the month:

00:00:26.819 --> 00:00:30.454
revenue, bookings, new customers, and your average rating,

00:00:30.404 --> 00:00:32.308
each compared with last month.

00:00:32.897 --> 00:00:35.667
Today's appointments lists each customer by time.

00:00:35.921 --> 00:00:40.636
And Needs attention reminds you of things that are waiting, such as unread messages,

00:00:40.586 --> 00:00:41.747
or orders to handle.

00:00:42.397 --> 00:00:45.276
Scroll further, and you'll see the next seven days,

00:00:45.226 --> 00:00:49.103
a chart of revenue over six months, and your top services this month.

00:00:49.360 --> 00:00:52.303
One quick scroll, and you know how the whole salon is doing.

00:00:52.557 --> 00:00:53.903
Now take the quiz below.
